        </ul>
        <p>
          I'm passionate about solving complex problems through innovative technologies and mathematical approaches. Check out my <a href="/publications/">publications</a> to learn more about my research work. Notes will be posted on the <a href="/blog/">blog</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="achievements">
        <h2>News</h2>
